%% Ask request sequence
%% Render: https://mermaid.live

sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant User
  participant UI as Web UI
  participant API as FastAPI
  participant SVC as AgentService
  participant LG as LangGraph
  participant VS as FAISS
  participant LLM as OpenAI

  User->>UI: Question
  UI->>API: POST /api/v1/ask
  API->>SVC: ask()
  SVC->>LG: invoke graph
  LG->>VS: hybrid retrieve
  VS-->>LG: chunks
  LG->>LLM: writer + critic
  LG-->>SVC: answer + citations
  SVC-->>API: response
  API-->>UI: JSON / SSE
  UI-->>User: answer with [N] citations
